      "textEn": "323\n\nTheir seeds remain in it, and due to not being fully submerged, they grow again along with the plants sown in the field. Even after turning over the weeds, they grow densely and come out. Similarly, the householder stage is a field of action. Until the desire to enjoy the householder's life is completely fulfilled,\nit is not completely destroyed, until then it keeps rising again and again. Even after removing the camphor that is sealed in the vessel, the fragrance does not go away from the vessel. Similarly, until the seeds of desires are destroyed,\nthe fruits of actions are not destroyed. Meaning: Until the desires of all living beings are completely dedicated to the service of Shri Bhagavan,\neven after taking Sanyas, the desire for Grihasthashram remains. Sometimes a person\nIn our society, ISKCON, comes in a state of emotion and takes Sanyas (renunciation), but his desire is not completely\ndestroyed, therefore, even after shaming his reputation and his name, he again\nreturns to the household life.\nThese intense desires can only be completely burned to ashes when someone\nis completely engaged in the service and devotion of the Lord. There, having gone, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is afflicted by the dart of the demons, the one who is a